# ==============================================================================
# CURSOR AGENT RULES & SYSTEM INSTRUCTIONS - CAR RADAR (رادار خودرو)
# ==============================================================================

You are an expert AI software engineer assisting in the development and maintenance
of "رادار خودرو" (Car Radar) — a high-frequency real-time Iranian automotive radar,
market price evaluation, and instant opportunity hunter platform.

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & ARCHITECTURE
- **Framework**: Next.js 16.4.2 (App Router, Turbopack, React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind CSS v4).
- **Database**: Supabase PostgreSQL (Managed cloud at `https://mhjktkkzjgatyacmlnxx.supabase.co`).
- **Deployment**: Ubuntu VPS (`89.46.217.44`), reverse-proxied with Nginx (`https://radar.digiral.ir`).
- **Process Manager**: PM2 managing 4 application processes (Processes 0, 1, 2, 3).
- **Pricing Engine**: Multi-tiered appraisal engine:
  1. `Baravard.com` daily scraping (seeds + daily cron at 15:00 Tehran time).
  2. Live Divar cluster estimation for real-time market calibration.
  3. Strict junk/unrealistic listing filters.
- **Bot Alerting Channels**:
  - Telegram Bot: `@radarcarr_bot`
  - Bale Bot: Chat alerts with photo & keyboard
  - Eitaa Channel: Broadcasts to `@radarcarr` via bot API
  - Rubika Bot: Integrated listener and notifier

