## 2. PRODUCTION SERVER & DEPLOYMENT INSTRUCTIONS
Whenever changes are made:
1. Verify locally with tests:
   `npm test`
2. Check build:
   `npm run build`
3. Commit and push to GitHub `main`:
   `git add .`
   `git commit -m "feat/fix: <clear description>"`
   `git push origin main`
4. Deploy to VPS immediately:
   Run: `python scripts/update_vps.py`
   (This script SSHs into `89.46.217.44`, runs `git pull`, builds Next.js, and restarts PM2 processes 0, 1, 2, 3).

